@id: cap:cli-ux-shell
@stratum: L2
@tag: user_facing
@substrate: Viewport:TodoList

Capability: Minimalist Terminal & Mobile Summary Projection
  Quantifier: For ANY user-facing feature on Viewport:TodoList, render high-priority badges first and tuck destructive actions (GDPR erase) behind an explicit confirmation guard.

  Scenario: Priority-ordered task board rendering
    Given multiple pending and completed tasks on Viewport:TodoList
    When the board is rendered
    Then tasks are displayed ordered by Urgency Score with clear recurrence and priority badges
